# SID 10000011 — Outbound ICMP (IPS: drop + alert)
# Paired with IDS SID 10000001 — same detection logic, blocking action.
# Requires: pfSense Snort interface set to Inline IPS Mode.
#
# STATUS: not yet tested in the lab (no Blocked-tab evidence for this
# SID). Only the MZ-signature IPS rule (SID 1000013) has confirmed
# blocking evidence so far — see results/test-results.md.
drop icmp $HOME_NET any -> $EXTERNAL_NET any (msg:"IPS: Outbound ping blocked"; sid:10000011; rev:1;)
